**PR description:**

> **Finance: check the session before parsing catalog terms input** (audit finding L3, Low)
>
> **Problem.** `saveCatalogTermsAction` (`finance/actions.ts:321-330`) ran `JSON.parse` and `CardTerms.safeParse` before calling the action built with `authedAction`. That breaks the AGENTS.md rule that every Server Action checks auth first: a caller without a session could get zod error text back. It wasn't reachable live, because the proxy sends a `Next-Action` POST without a session a 307 to `/signin`.
