> **Change.** All parsing and validation now runs inside `authedAction`, so `requireUser()` runs first. The user-facing messages are unchanged ("Not valid JSON", plus up to 3 zod issues). Revalidation happens only on success. The terms string is capped at 100k characters; the largest seed terms JSON is about 1.9k.
>
> **Known edge.** Input over 100k characters now throws a ZodError instead of returning a form error.
>
> **Tests.** New `tests/finance-actions-auth.test.ts` checks that a caller without a session gets `Unauthorized` for both bad and valid-looking JSON, that nothing is saved, and that a signed-in member still sees "Not valid JSON". The first test fails on the old code.
>
> Reviewed by household-reviewer (approve) and challenger (ship).
